h: 2em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D462 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D463 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>maps the region <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"58\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c394\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> from the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"59\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D462 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D463 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-plane to <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"60\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D437 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> Which of the following could be the region <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"61\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c394\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>?</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div><table class=\"questionWidget-choicesTable\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-160949-a\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\" style=\"background: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: white;\">a</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-160949-a-4\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-160949-b\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">b</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-160949-a-5\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-160949-c\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">c</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-160949-a-1\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-160949-d\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">d</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-160949-a-2\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-160949-e\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">e</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-160949-a-3\"> </td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-incorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/incorrect-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-incorrectText\">Incorrect</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>For our transformation <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"62\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D413 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">T</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> we have</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"63\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; positio